                        <span class="inner-wrap">
                            <span class="month">FEB</span>
                            <span class="year">2025</span>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="news-minutiae">
                        <h4>中小學師赴澳洲觀課 反饋創新教案結合氣候變遷</h4>
