                        <span class="inner-wrap">
                            <span class="month">DEC</span>
                            <span class="year">2024</span>
                        </span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="news-minutiae">
                        <h4>選送中小學國際教育教師赴澳洲深度觀議課 提升教育新視野</h4>
                    </div>
                </a>
